<title>USA: Diametrics Medical Inc Q4 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Diametrics Medical Inc Q4 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $0.43     loss	 $0.54</p>
<p> Net	 loss	   6,478     loss	 8,062</p>
<p> Revs			 1,934			587</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  15,189		   14,865</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 research and development costs $1,386,670 vs $1,848,774.</p>
<p>Q4 1996 results include $809,360 in restructuring and other charges vs year-ago chares of $391,834.  </p>
<p>Q4 1996 charge includes write-off of excess and obsolete equipment, write-off of purchased in-process research and development from acquisition of Biomedical Sensors Ltd and severance charges from work force reduction.</p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr	loss	    $1.56     loss	 $1.82</p>
<p> Net	loss	   23,575     loss	23,046</p>
<p> Revs			 3,797		    1,607</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  15,088		   12,640</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year 1996 research and development expenses $6,056,246 vs $6,320,739.</p>
<p>Full-year 1996 also includes restructuring and other charges of $1,334,661 vs $391,834.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
